	<string>public.app-category.photography</string>
	<key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key>
	<string>13.0</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Used for the optional all-sky/rig safety monitor, and to use an iPhone or other Continuity Camera/USB webcam as a live capture source (e.g. eyepiece afocal photography) — the ZWO ASI SDK path talks to ASI cameras directly over USB and doesn't need this permission.</string>
